Kyle’s face grew more anxious as he checked his watch. There wasn’t enough time to wait for Layla to recover from her illness, or to wade through all the red tape to get her out of Sienne legally. There was no official word from headquarters yet, but he could tell from the fact that the soldiers were preparing for battle that the enemy army would be arriving very soon.
Sienne would turn back into a dangerous battlefield in no time. He thus had to get Layla out of the city right away. But how could he manage that when there was a lockdown order? A feeling of panic started to course through his veins.
