“What’s the status of her travel pass?” Kyle asked. He knew it had almost certainly been canceled like all other civilian passes, but he was holding on to the last thread of hope.
Matthias said nothing, confirming the sad truth that the pass had been canceled.
“Then Layla won’t be able to-”
“Layla will leave Sienne right away,” Matthias affirmed in a confident tone. “But aren’t civilians barred from travel?”
