“What? Uh… Yeah, I know how to drive. Why do you ask…?” Kyle looked quizzically at Matthias.
Matthias, meanwhile, was looking across the square, where several ambulances were rushing to and fro. All severely injured patients at the field

hospital were being transported to the hospital in the rear before the enemies landed.
