Kyle again.
Whatever he was planning, he had clearly made up his mind already.







Layla checked her suitcase once more before closing it. Then she put on her shoes and buttoned up her coat. All that was left for her to do was head to the spot where Kyle had told her to meet him. There were still a few hours until they were supposed to meet, but she had finished getting ready early.
