I’m leaving, she repeated over and over again in her mind. I’m leaving this city. I’m leaving behind that man and all the time I spent under his control. Now I

can forget all that and start a new life with my baby. A new life without the slightest trace of the duke in it. That’s what’s best for me, for the baby, and for the duke.
Suddenly the silence inside the house became difficult to bear, and she opened the curtains a crack. A sliver of moonlight seeped into the room.
While Kyle drove the ambulance to the meeting spot, Marquess Lindman was going to come to the house, and the two of them would walk together to meet up with Kyle. It was a simple plan, and she was sure it would go off without a hitch.
